  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NOR/HP - Coordinated Hospital and Community Mental Health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mental health and psychosocial well-being of vulnerable populations will improve through increased access to prevention and treatment at local health facilities with support from community-based mechanisms. Target groups will participate meaningfully in family and community social activities. Women experiencing abuse will have their practical needs met and be supported through formal and informal mechanisms in a community with changed social norms and attitudes about violence against women.</narrative>
  </description>
